=You are a supply chain risk analyst. Analyze this supplier's performance metrics and classify their risk level.

--- SUPPLIER DATA ---
Supplier Name   : {{ $json.supplier }}
Category        : {{ $json.category }}
Region          : {{ $json.region }}
Total Orders    : {{ $json.orders }}
Delivered       : {{ $json.delivered }}
Fulfillment Rate: {{ $json.fulfillmentPct }}%
Avg Delay (days): {{ $json.delay }}
Risk Score      : {{ $json.riskScore }} / 100
Auto Flags      : {{ $json.flags }}

--- INSTRUCTIONS ---
Based on the above data, respond ONLY with a valid JSON object. No markdown, no backticks, no extra text.

{
  "risk": "Low" or "Medium" or "High",
  "reason": "One sentence explaining the primary risk driver",
  "confidence": "Low" or "Medium" or "High"
}

