Risk Reason      : {{ $('Validate & Merge Risk Output').item.json.reason }}
AI Confidence    : {{ $('Validate & Merge Risk Output').item.json.confidence }}

--- TASK ---
Provide exactly 3 numbered, specific procurement actions to immediately mitigate this supplier's risk. Each action should be:
- Concrete and actionable (not generic advice)
- Relevant to the specific failure metrics shown above
- Achievable within 2 weeks

Respond in plain text only. Number each recommendation (1. 2. 3.).

